{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方公演もすべて終わり、\n残るは神宮でのバースデーライブ\nのみになりました。\n乃木坂5周年おめでとう！\n欅ちゃん1周年おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんいつもありがとう\nございます！これからも\n一緒に坂を登ってください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、\nこんばんは！\n伊藤純奈です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/08/23/4468572/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/08/23/4468572/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアー地方公演が全て終了しました！\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若しゃま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/08/23/4468572/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/08/23/4468572/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この衣装すごい可愛くて\nお気に入りです。\n色んなタイプがあるんだけど\n純は脇腹が空いてるタイプで\n若様とか松村さんとか生田さんとか\nまあやさんとかと一緒です\nかわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちわ、タオルぜんぶぜんぶ\n見えてました！見つけるとすごい\n嬉しいんですあれ。\nありがとう愛してる(^O^)♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方でご飯に行った時に\n流れでスイカメンバーに\nなーさんが加入したよ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/08/23/4468572/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左からなーさん、てぃーちゃん(川後)\n純奈、かりん、ゆっちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡から東京に戻った日に\n5人でディズニーに行ってきました♡\nアクティブな女達。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バースデーライブまであと少し！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/08/23/4468572/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばるぞーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また神宮前に更新しますっ。\nばいぴち(^_^)"}],"source":"archive"}